"D",
"Two servers. Two! On a Saturday. I have six courses and a lady in green who already sent back the bread."
],
"2": [
"aca990c8-4d9d-41e5-a23e-b99a225f2e39",
"E",
"Where are the aprons?"
],
"3": [
